WEBVTT

01:24.880 --> 01:27.480
ADAPTED FROM
THE LEGEND OF KUNSHAN JADE BY TAN TIANYIN

01:35.040 --> 01:37.040
With both witnesses and evidence present,

01:37.120 --> 01:38.640
what do you have left to deny?

01:40.480 --> 01:41.760
Let me ask you again.

01:41.840 --> 01:43.720
Why were Xu Nanying's bribes

01:44.280 --> 01:46.080
at your Baicaojing House?

01:46.880 --> 01:48.000
Inspector Zhang,

01:48.080 --> 01:50.120
it has nothing to do with Qin Mu.

01:50.200 --> 01:51.440
I did it.

01:51.520 --> 01:53.400
Yeah. She did it.

01:53.480 --> 01:54.760
I only lent her the place.

01:54.840 --> 01:56.520
I didn't know what she was doing.

01:56.600 --> 01:57.760
Bai Niao.

01:57.840 --> 02:00.040
Do you know

02:00.640 --> 02:01.840
that harboring bribes
is a capital offense?

02:03.960 --> 02:06.640
Lady Bai, clear your mind.

02:06.720 --> 02:08.120
It's a capital offense.

02:13.200 --> 02:14.600
Qin Mu.

02:16.080 --> 02:18.280
Why did you lend your Baicaojing House

02:18.360 --> 02:20.400
to Bai Niao for no reason?

02:23.960 --> 02:24.800
Because…

02:28.440 --> 02:31.000
Because she's like a sister to me.

02:31.080 --> 02:34.000
I had to do t.

02:38.120 --> 02:40.400
You finally admit

02:42.280 --> 02:44.760
that you think of me as a sister.

02:48.600 --> 02:49.800
When you were a kid,

02:51.920 --> 02:54.720
I took you to Yangzhou.

02:56.480 --> 02:59.200
You were seriously ill.

03:00.400 --> 03:02.000
I had no choice

03:02.080 --> 03:05.040
but to sell myself.

03:05.560 --> 03:09.040
I managed to get the money

03:09.120 --> 03:10.520
to treat you.

03:13.760 --> 03:15.000
When you grew up,

03:16.000 --> 03:18.320
I supported you.

03:19.520 --> 03:22.040
I hope you can bring honor to our family.

03:22.880 --> 03:24.560
Father, Mother.

03:25.480 --> 03:26.840
It's all my fault.

03:27.800 --> 03:29.400
I didn't take good care of Mu.

03:29.480 --> 03:31.280
Shut up.

03:31.360 --> 03:33.840
When did you say that?

03:34.400 --> 03:35.840
Isn't it embarrassing enough?

03:39.200 --> 03:41.200
Do you think

03:41.280 --> 03:42.760
I'm willing to be an orphan

03:42.840 --> 03:44.640
that no one loves?

03:46.160 --> 03:48.040
If it weren't for a songstress,

03:48.840 --> 03:51.480
we wouldn't be here.

03:53.840 --> 03:54.880
Do you know

03:55.960 --> 03:56.960
how much I've been through

03:57.600 --> 03:59.200
to get to where I am today

04:00.040 --> 04:02.200
because you are a songstress?

04:04.600 --> 04:06.720
I'd rather you weren't my sister.

04:10.960 --> 04:13.480
You'd rather I wasn't your sister?

04:15.480 --> 04:16.680
Enough.

04:16.760 --> 04:18.800
I need evidence.

04:20.320 --> 04:23.240
I don't need your nonsense.

04:23.920 --> 04:24.760
Qin Mu.

04:26.840 --> 04:29.840
Can you prove what you're saying is true?

04:33.000 --> 04:35.000
I have proof. I have proof!

04:36.640 --> 04:38.440
She has an affair with Xu Nanying.

04:38.520 --> 04:40.720
She's been taking bribes
on Xu Nanying's behalf.

04:43.120 --> 04:43.960
I put everything

04:44.040 --> 04:46.080
in a ledger.

04:47.040 --> 04:48.760
Inspector Zhang, please investigate.

04:51.720 --> 04:52.760
Yeah.

04:53.560 --> 04:55.320
I did everything.

04:55.400 --> 04:57.400
I embezzled jewelry.

04:57.480 --> 04:59.080
I had an affair with Xu Nanying.

04:59.160 --> 05:01.680
I harbored stolen goods and sold them.

05:01.760 --> 05:04.360
I, Bai Niao, did everything.

05:04.440 --> 05:07.800
It has nothing to do with Qin Mu.

05:07.880 --> 05:10.760
Inspector Zhang, I'm at your disposal.

05:14.480 --> 05:15.320
Qin Mu.

05:16.720 --> 05:18.360
You poisoned Yuanxiang.

05:19.360 --> 05:21.320
I sentence you to 50 cane strokes
and a fine of three million.

05:21.920 --> 05:23.720
You can't leave Yangzhou

05:23.800 --> 05:24.760
until Xu Nanying's case is cleared.

05:24.840 --> 05:25.800
Take him down.

05:25.880 --> 05:26.720
-Yes, sir.
-Yes, sir.

05:26.800 --> 05:28.440
I'm innocent.

05:28.520 --> 05:30.440
I'm innocent.

05:30.520 --> 05:31.480
Stupid woman.

05:31.560 --> 05:33.560
It's all your fault. You're killing me.

05:33.640 --> 05:34.800
Stupid woman.

05:34.880 --> 05:36.880
I'm innocent, my lord.

05:39.000 --> 05:40.800
Move fast. Be careful.

05:40.880 --> 05:41.720
Okay.

05:43.560 --> 05:44.720
Come again.

05:46.520 --> 05:49.040
Tong. How's it going?

05:49.120 --> 05:50.800
It's almost done, Lady Shijiu.
There are only a few boxes left.

05:50.880 --> 05:52.600
Put your goods down.

05:55.120 --> 05:56.760
Who is Lady Shijiu?

05:59.880 --> 06:00.720
It's me.

06:02.000 --> 06:03.080
Inspector Zhang is investigating a case.

06:03.160 --> 06:04.120
Please come with us.

06:05.560 --> 06:07.840
What does it have to do with me?

06:07.920 --> 06:09.840
We're here under orders.

06:09.920 --> 06:11.120
Please come with us.

06:12.600 --> 06:14.200
Lady Shijiu.

06:14.280 --> 06:16.280
Don't worry. Take care of the shop.

06:17.520 --> 06:18.960
-Yes, ma'am.
-Please.

06:22.320 --> 06:23.880
Lady Shijiu.

06:25.640 --> 06:27.120
What do we do?

06:33.200 --> 06:34.920
Why did the jewelry
in Zhenlang Pavilion disappear

06:36.680 --> 06:38.840
after the auction?

06:40.440 --> 06:42.760
Why did it appear in Baicaojing House?

06:42.840 --> 06:44.080
I don't know.

06:44.840 --> 06:46.320
Zhenlang Pavilion was an empty shop

06:46.400 --> 06:47.600
when I took it over.

06:47.680 --> 06:49.520
Are you saying

06:50.800 --> 06:52.800
that Mr. Xu took away the jewelry?

06:53.440 --> 06:54.560
Or did you bribe him with the jewelry

06:54.640 --> 06:55.680
to get Zhenlang Pavilion back?

07:00.040 --> 07:02.680
Lady Shijiu, you acquiesced, right?

07:19.120 --> 07:20.040
Cui Shijiu.

07:20.920 --> 07:23.360
Do you know
these South Sea tribute pearls?

07:24.160 --> 07:27.080
Why were they in Baicaojing House

07:27.800 --> 07:29.640
with Yan's Zhenlang Pavilion's jewelry?

07:30.760 --> 07:32.120
The tribute pearls case was closed

07:33.680 --> 07:35.320
in Chang'an.

07:37.520 --> 07:39.760
I don't know where they came from.

07:50.640 --> 07:53.480
These South Sea tribute pearls
were all from Cui's Pearl Farm.

07:54.360 --> 07:56.600
They are not

07:56.680 --> 07:58.600
in Yan's Zhenlang Pavilion's manifest.

07:59.880 --> 08:00.720
Cui Shijiu.

08:02.000 --> 08:03.360
Can you prove where they came from?

08:04.240 --> 08:06.440
If my Cui family had tribute pearls,

08:09.040 --> 08:10.600
we wouldn't be where we are today.

08:10.680 --> 08:12.000
That is to say,

08:13.120 --> 08:14.800
those South Sea tribute pearls were there

08:16.160 --> 08:18.720
before you took over Zhenlang Pavilion.

08:18.800 --> 08:19.720
No.

08:20.520 --> 08:22.280
I should say

08:22.360 --> 08:23.320
before the Cui family's
tribute pearls fraud case.

08:23.400 --> 08:25.160
I have feelings for Zhenlang Pavilion.

08:25.240 --> 08:26.800
That's why I bought it.

08:26.880 --> 08:29.120
I don't know anything
about those tribute pearls

08:29.200 --> 08:31.120
-and those goods.
-Inspector Zhang.

08:35.200 --> 08:36.600
Zheng Zhiheng has something to report.

08:37.200 --> 08:38.679
-Let him in.
-Yes, sir.

08:46.200 --> 08:48.080
-Inspector Zhang.
-Zheng Zhiheng.

08:49.240 --> 08:50.200
What is it?

08:52.000 --> 08:53.400
Cui Shijiu

08:53.480 --> 08:55.440
wanted to buy the Zhenlang Pavilion
from the government,

08:55.520 --> 08:57.960
but Xu Nanying took the opportunity

08:58.040 --> 09:01.400
to ask Cui Shijiu for all the goods
in Zhenlang Pavilion.

09:01.480 --> 09:03.440
I was there as a witness.

09:03.520 --> 09:04.920
I can find witnesses to prove

09:05.000 --> 09:08.040
how the jewelry got from Zhenlang Pavilion
to Baicaojing House.

09:08.120 --> 09:10.040
I can confront Xu Nanying.

09:10.120 --> 09:14.040
This box of tribute pearls
has nothing to do with Cui Shijiu.

09:14.120 --> 09:17.160
Inspector Zhang, please investigate.

09:25.680 --> 09:27.920
GRAND GOVERNOR'S OFFICE

09:35.320 --> 09:36.840
Mr. Zheng, the master wants to see you.

09:40.840 --> 09:41.680
Shijiu.

09:42.400 --> 09:43.360
Go back to Zhenlang Pavilion first.

09:44.360 --> 09:45.200
Go.

09:46.040 --> 09:48.520
Don't worry. It will be all right.

09:49.680 --> 09:50.520
The patriarch said

09:50.600 --> 09:52.840
the master wants to see you
and Lady Shijiu.

10:05.400 --> 10:06.240
Wu.

10:07.160 --> 10:08.400
For this woman,

10:08.480 --> 10:11.360
the Zheng family lost a lot of money,

10:11.440 --> 10:13.040
and Prince Ying lost Xu Nanying.

10:13.720 --> 10:14.800
Tell me.

10:14.880 --> 10:16.280
How am I supposed to punish you?

10:16.360 --> 10:18.200
It was my idea.

10:19.120 --> 10:20.000
It has nothing to do with Cui Shijiu.

10:23.880 --> 10:24.800
Someone.

10:25.400 --> 10:26.680
Punish him according to the family rules.

10:27.960 --> 10:31.080
Master, please leave him alone.

10:31.160 --> 10:32.600
He realized his mistake.

10:32.680 --> 10:34.400
Hold him down

10:34.480 --> 10:35.680
and cane him.

10:36.640 --> 10:38.880
Wu, apologize to your father.

10:38.960 --> 10:41.640
Apologize. Say you're wrong.

10:41.720 --> 10:42.560
Say it.

10:42.640 --> 10:44.960
The Zheng family bribed Xu Nanying

10:45.040 --> 10:46.320
with a lot of money,

10:46.400 --> 10:49.000
but this money became evidence
of Xu Nanying's guilt.

10:49.680 --> 10:51.400
Cui Shijiu got Zhenlang Pavilion,

10:51.480 --> 10:53.200
but she didn't make anything out of it.

10:53.280 --> 10:54.520
Pig.

10:54.600 --> 10:55.920
What do you think of the Zheng family?

11:02.280 --> 11:03.160
Mr. Zheng.

11:03.800 --> 11:05.160
It's none of his business.

11:05.240 --> 11:06.360
Cane me if you want.

11:06.440 --> 11:08.920
Cui Shijiu.
You are not my daughter-in-law.

11:09.000 --> 11:10.640
I can't cane you.

11:10.720 --> 11:12.360
But I underestimated you.

11:13.040 --> 11:15.120
Xu Nanying is finished.
The Zheng family is finished.

11:15.200 --> 11:16.320
What's in it for you?

11:16.400 --> 11:18.160
If I didn't do that,
how would the Cui family…?

11:18.240 --> 11:19.320
Shut up. It's all your fault!

11:19.400 --> 11:20.440
Mother!

11:20.520 --> 11:22.520
Wu. Sober up.

11:22.600 --> 11:25.040
She's been using you!

11:25.120 --> 11:28.640
If you go on like this,
you will killed by her.

11:28.720 --> 11:29.600
Master.

11:29.680 --> 11:32.240
Please have mercy.

11:32.320 --> 11:33.960
-Cane him!
-Master!

11:34.040 --> 11:35.240
Keep caning!

11:35.320 --> 11:38.600
You will kill him, Master!

11:40.640 --> 11:43.800
Master, please have mercy!

11:51.680 --> 11:52.520
Senior.

11:54.280 --> 11:55.800
Do you regret

11:55.880 --> 11:57.120
coming this far?

12:00.000 --> 12:01.720
I'm a prisoner.

12:02.880 --> 12:04.240
I have nothing to say.

12:05.480 --> 12:07.160
I didn't expect you

12:07.680 --> 12:10.280
to call me senior.

12:11.040 --> 12:12.280
The law comes first.

12:13.440 --> 12:14.520
But we have a personal relationship.

12:14.600 --> 12:16.840
Don't try to lecture me.

12:18.360 --> 12:21.000
If you are not from a famous family,

12:21.080 --> 12:23.360
how could you learn from our master

12:23.440 --> 12:25.400
at a young age,

12:25.480 --> 12:27.600
be appreciated by Prince Ying,

12:27.680 --> 12:29.520
and be recommended to the Emperor?

12:29.600 --> 12:32.160
You've always been better than me.

12:32.880 --> 12:35.800
Now, you don't care
that I'm your senior brother

12:35.880 --> 12:38.040
and go after me.

12:39.920 --> 12:41.200
You're

12:42.280 --> 12:43.880
ungrateful.

12:43.960 --> 12:45.720
I am ungrateful?

12:46.400 --> 12:48.320
Prince Tan appreciated you.

12:49.120 --> 12:51.600
But you left him and went to Prince Ying.

12:51.680 --> 12:53.400
You succeeded easily

12:54.720 --> 12:56.440
and gained the trust of Prince Ying.

12:57.800 --> 12:59.640
How did you do it?

13:00.680 --> 13:03.000
Switching sides is a taboo in life.

13:03.840 --> 13:05.800
Why does Prince Ying trust you?

13:08.080 --> 13:10.680
A wise man chooses a good master to serve.

13:11.280 --> 13:13.720
Don't ask me about it.

13:13.800 --> 13:14.960
You can

13:15.560 --> 13:17.280
ask Prince Ying.

13:19.040 --> 13:20.400
Looks like

13:21.160 --> 13:22.760
you don't want to be honest with me.

13:23.320 --> 13:24.720
Say no more.

13:24.800 --> 13:26.200
In your current position,

13:26.280 --> 13:27.960
you can't convict me.

13:28.600 --> 13:30.240
If you want to convict me,

13:31.360 --> 13:33.520
we'll talk about it
when we get to Chang'an.

13:38.600 --> 13:40.120
I can't convict you.

13:41.840 --> 13:44.040
But Qin Mu, Bai Niao, and Cui Shijiu

13:44.800 --> 13:47.160
have made a confession.

13:47.240 --> 13:49.080
They have presented all the evidence.

13:50.560 --> 13:52.280
I have written to the Emperor

13:52.360 --> 13:54.320
to explain the situation.

13:55.000 --> 13:56.600
Prince Ying can't do anything about it.

14:00.440 --> 14:01.400
Senior.

14:03.520 --> 14:05.040
Can you still be so calm

14:07.080 --> 14:09.240
when you get to the Court
of Judicial Review?

14:19.760 --> 14:22.440
Jinran.

14:22.520 --> 14:23.520
Jinran.

14:23.600 --> 14:24.600
Jinran.

14:25.760 --> 14:27.120
Jinran, don't go.

14:28.160 --> 14:31.280
Please help me, Jinran.

14:31.880 --> 14:33.680
I beg you on my knees.

14:33.760 --> 14:35.560
Think about our master.

14:35.640 --> 14:37.280
If he knows

14:37.360 --> 14:39.000
we are against each other,

14:39.760 --> 14:42.200
he will be upset.

14:45.240 --> 14:47.120
Think about our master.

14:49.360 --> 14:50.400
Jinran.

14:51.040 --> 14:52.280
Jinran.

14:52.360 --> 14:53.400
Jinran.

14:54.080 --> 14:55.400
Jinran!

15:06.120 --> 15:07.680
I know one thing

15:07.760 --> 15:10.200
from 16 years ago.

15:10.280 --> 15:11.600
Yan's Trading Convoy.

15:12.200 --> 15:13.280
Black Dragon Bandits.

15:15.400 --> 15:16.440
Yan's Trading Convoy?

15:17.440 --> 15:18.720
It was a long time ago.

15:19.800 --> 15:20.960
It doesn't make any sense to mention it.

15:21.040 --> 15:22.480
No one brings it up

15:22.560 --> 15:24.520
because it's not the right time.

15:24.600 --> 15:27.440
Then we'll die together!

16:00.080 --> 16:02.480
ZHANG JINRAN IS GOING AFTER THE OLD CASE

17:07.040 --> 17:11.040
BAICAOJING HOUSE

17:24.720 --> 17:26.040
Mu.

17:26.599 --> 17:28.040
Am I beautiful?

17:28.720 --> 17:30.600
I won the top beauty title again.

17:32.520 --> 17:35.200
I'll make a lot of money

17:35.280 --> 17:37.400
to open a branch for you.

17:38.600 --> 17:41.040
I'll find you a wife.

17:42.640 --> 17:44.640
She's been like this
since she got out of jail.

17:44.720 --> 17:45.600
She's crazy.

17:45.680 --> 17:47.280
She doesn't recognize people.

17:47.360 --> 17:48.680
We don't let her out

17:48.760 --> 17:50.760
because we're afraid
someone will mess with her.

17:50.840 --> 17:52.200
We can only lock her in the room.

17:59.600 --> 18:01.440
I'm still the Top Beauty.

18:01.520 --> 18:04.040
Qin Mu is ruthless.

18:04.120 --> 18:05.640
Look at his sister.

18:05.720 --> 18:06.920
He doesn't even care about her.

18:10.480 --> 18:12.520
Get a loyal servant to take care of her.

18:13.200 --> 18:14.960
Duckweed Society will pay for it.

18:16.440 --> 18:17.440
Ms. Su.

18:18.400 --> 18:19.480
She tried to destroy you,

18:19.560 --> 18:21.160
but you want to take care of her.

18:21.240 --> 18:22.360
Yeah.

18:23.400 --> 18:26.000
I thank you for Lady Bai.

18:26.080 --> 18:27.600
Have children…

18:29.120 --> 18:30.760
This is

18:31.600 --> 18:32.880
her punishment.

18:35.600 --> 18:37.720
The one who should be punished

18:42.080 --> 18:43.520
should not have gone far.

19:04.200 --> 19:05.040
Hurry.

19:06.240 --> 19:07.120
Next.

19:10.320 --> 19:11.440
Go.

19:12.600 --> 19:13.880
Stop.

19:13.960 --> 19:16.120
Gadgets. Have a look.

19:16.720 --> 19:18.040
Have a look.

19:33.400 --> 19:34.400
Don't run!

19:34.480 --> 19:35.360
-What?
-Stop!

19:37.440 --> 19:39.960
-What do you want? You…
-Get him back!

19:40.720 --> 19:41.880
Don't move!

19:42.400 --> 19:43.640
-What do you want to do?
-Beat him!

19:43.720 --> 19:45.280
-What do you want?
-I'll kill you!

19:45.840 --> 19:47.800
-I'll kill you!
-Help!

19:47.880 --> 19:49.560
-Beat him!
-Beat him!

19:49.640 --> 19:51.160
You're ruthless!

19:51.240 --> 19:52.600
Out of the way!

20:03.880 --> 20:04.760
Give it to me!

20:06.040 --> 20:08.440
It's robbery.

20:08.520 --> 20:09.760
I'll go to the officer!

20:09.840 --> 20:11.200
Robbery?

20:11.280 --> 20:13.280
We are just taking back
what belongs to Lady Bai.

20:16.480 --> 20:18.640
What's wrong with you?

20:18.720 --> 20:20.040
She tried to destroy you.

20:20.120 --> 20:22.800
Lady Bai will take her punishment.

20:22.880 --> 20:24.280
You're scum.

20:24.360 --> 20:26.360
You're ruthless to your sister.

20:26.880 --> 20:27.720
You deserve to die!

20:34.000 --> 20:34.840
Miss.

20:35.360 --> 20:37.880
Miss, please leave something for me.
Leave something for me.

20:37.960 --> 20:39.680
-Otherwise, how will I…
-Go on beating him!

20:40.800 --> 20:43.040
-Die!
-Help!

20:43.120 --> 20:44.000
Help!

20:44.080 --> 20:45.440
-I'll kill you!
-You're ruthless!

20:47.600 --> 20:48.920
It's time to eat.

20:56.400 --> 20:57.760
It's time to eat. Come on.

21:08.640 --> 21:09.680
It's time to eat.

21:16.000 --> 21:16.880
What do you want?

21:18.200 --> 21:19.640
Get down.

21:20.320 --> 21:23.440
Take this letter to Chang'an

21:23.520 --> 21:24.880
and hand it over to Prince Ying in person.

21:24.960 --> 21:26.840
I can't do it.

21:28.120 --> 21:29.760
If you deliver it to him,

21:29.840 --> 21:31.480
you'll be rich.

21:33.560 --> 21:37.320
I'm framed.

21:37.400 --> 21:40.400
As long as this letter
is sent to Chang'an,

21:40.480 --> 21:42.240
I will return to my post.

21:42.320 --> 21:45.320
I'll promote you at that time.

21:47.640 --> 21:48.880
Understand?

21:56.960 --> 21:59.160
Remember.

22:05.080 --> 22:06.000
Xu Lin.

22:06.080 --> 22:09.040
You don't have to follow me to Yangzhou.

22:10.320 --> 22:11.600
Mr. Xu…

22:12.560 --> 22:13.800
Take this letter.

22:13.880 --> 22:15.120
Don't appear in Yangzhou

22:15.640 --> 22:17.040
without my summon.

22:19.720 --> 22:23.320
Mr. Xu, is the journey dangerous?

22:23.960 --> 22:25.520
The future is uncertain.

22:26.200 --> 22:27.440
I need to be prepared.

22:28.120 --> 22:30.200
You can save my life.

22:31.000 --> 22:34.000
Don't expose yourself.

22:37.120 --> 22:37.960
Yes, sir.

22:42.760 --> 22:45.520
Xu Nanying asked Chang'an for help.

22:50.200 --> 22:54.760
Your Highness, this is Xu Nanying.

22:55.320 --> 22:58.040
Zhang Jinran is not loyal to you.

22:58.120 --> 23:00.560
He's going after the old case.

23:00.640 --> 23:03.920
I tried my best
to maintain the situation in Yangzhou.

23:04.520 --> 23:06.600
But he framed me.

23:07.120 --> 23:11.680
I was put in prison for bribery.

23:11.760 --> 23:13.120
It's quiet in the forest.

23:13.200 --> 23:14.720
I'm afraid I'm in danger.

23:14.800 --> 23:18.640
Please save me

23:18.720 --> 23:22.120
to save Yangzhou.

23:24.080 --> 23:26.640
There are many people
in the Grand Governor's Office.

23:27.520 --> 23:28.920
He wrote this letter.

23:29.000 --> 23:30.440
He won't stop.

23:30.520 --> 23:31.520
Yes.

23:32.480 --> 23:34.120
Unless he has another way,

23:34.920 --> 23:37.680
his letter will not reach Chang'an

23:37.760 --> 23:39.000
before my memorial.

23:39.080 --> 23:41.120
There's no point in him calling for help.

23:43.880 --> 23:45.760
Maybe his letter meant more

23:47.040 --> 23:47.960
than just a cry for help.

23:53.560 --> 23:55.480
It's quiet in the forest.

23:56.160 --> 23:57.440
I'm afraid I'm in danger.

23:59.960 --> 24:01.800
It's quiet in the forest…

24:02.560 --> 24:03.840
Forest…

24:07.160 --> 24:08.360
Xu Lin?

24:13.640 --> 24:15.520
Xu Lin didn't follow Xu Nanying

24:16.320 --> 24:17.800
to Yangzhou.

24:19.200 --> 24:21.520
Xu Lin disappeared
after the case in Guangzhou.

24:22.200 --> 24:24.640
After Xu Nanying went to Prince Ying,

24:24.720 --> 24:25.920
he was promoted to Yangzhou.

24:26.000 --> 24:28.520
But Xu Lin didn't follow him.

24:28.600 --> 24:30.400
Does Xu Lin

24:32.000 --> 24:34.280
have something on Prince Ying?

24:35.160 --> 24:37.040
It can get Xu Nanying promoted.

24:38.720 --> 24:39.720
It's possible.

24:41.840 --> 24:43.960
In addition to calling for help,

24:45.640 --> 24:46.760
the letter is a threat.

24:54.960 --> 24:56.000
Mr. Zhang.

24:57.600 --> 25:00.040
The messenger said that Prince Ying
was about to have his 40th birthday.

25:00.560 --> 25:01.400
He sent you the letter

25:01.480 --> 25:02.920
inviting you to go back to the capital
to participate in his birthday party.

25:07.400 --> 25:10.320
And I have interrogated
Xu Nanying's officers.

25:10.400 --> 25:12.440
Their confessions are pretty much
the same as before.

25:12.520 --> 25:13.880
Do you want me to catch his servants?

25:13.960 --> 25:15.720
There must be someone weak among them.

25:15.800 --> 25:17.360
Someone will confess under the caning.

25:19.880 --> 25:21.440
There is no point
in torturing his servants.

25:21.520 --> 25:23.000
ZHANG JINRAN, INSPECTOR OF HUAINANDAO

25:23.080 --> 25:25.720
Xu Lin is the key to this.

25:27.040 --> 25:28.320
Xu Nanying
has just been taken into custody.

25:28.400 --> 25:29.520
HUAINANDAO

25:29.600 --> 25:32.200
Prince Ying sent a letter
to ask me to return to Chang'an.

25:32.280 --> 25:33.920
It's a test.

25:34.000 --> 25:36.320
We will encounter more obstacles
in the future.

25:36.400 --> 25:37.240
We're running out of time.

25:41.760 --> 25:42.960
Send this memorial

25:43.040 --> 25:44.800
to Chang'an

25:44.880 --> 25:45.920
as soon as possible.

25:48.840 --> 25:49.680
Yes, sir.

25:59.200 --> 26:00.760
ZHANG JINRAN, INSPECTOR OF HUAINANDAO
YANGZHOU GRAND GOVERNOR'S OFFICE

26:05.320 --> 26:07.520
You used to compete with Prince Tan.

26:08.960 --> 26:10.720
You said you wanted

26:11.640 --> 26:13.000
to bring integrity and justice

26:13.680 --> 26:14.960
to the country.

26:19.240 --> 26:20.200
This time,

26:22.160 --> 26:24.440
I'll practice integrity and justice.

26:36.760 --> 26:38.080
How's it going?

26:38.680 --> 26:39.880
Everything was sold.

26:40.480 --> 26:41.800
We invested so much in it.

26:41.880 --> 26:44.080
We lost more than 20%
by selling in such a hurry.

26:44.160 --> 26:45.760
Money will come and go.

26:46.400 --> 26:48.560
We can make Zhang Jinran less stressed

26:49.200 --> 26:51.120
and make Yangzhou's case

26:51.200 --> 26:52.320
easier.

26:52.400 --> 26:54.200
If something happens to me,

26:55.360 --> 26:56.960
I can leave something for Duanwu.

26:57.040 --> 26:58.400
Don't jinx it.

26:58.480 --> 27:00.000
You must be healthy.

27:04.760 --> 27:05.680
Well…

27:06.840 --> 27:07.680
Master.

27:08.960 --> 27:09.880
You are obedient.

27:09.960 --> 27:11.960
You're more obedient
than Duanwu used to be.

27:13.960 --> 27:16.160
We're depending on others.

27:16.240 --> 27:17.680
We should do something for them.

27:19.360 --> 27:20.880
It's your turn.

27:37.080 --> 27:40.520
ZHENLANG PAVILION

27:51.400 --> 27:53.000
-Let's go.
-They have a special offer for opening.

27:53.080 --> 27:54.360
-Let's have a look.
-Have a look.

28:01.480 --> 28:03.680
Ladies and gentlemen, please be quiet.

28:04.200 --> 28:05.200
Lady Shijiu.

28:06.040 --> 28:07.200
Ladies and gentlemen,

28:07.280 --> 28:09.360
Today is the reopening day
of Cui's Zhenlang Pavilion.

28:09.440 --> 28:11.880
To thank our new and existing customers
in Yangzhou,

28:11.960 --> 28:14.600
all products are half price.

28:15.960 --> 28:18.280
Zhenlang Pavilion
goes back to the Cui family.

28:19.000 --> 28:20.120
Ladies and gentlemen,

28:20.200 --> 28:22.040
please go in and have a look.

28:22.120 --> 28:23.280
-We have a variety of styles.
-Let's have a look.

28:23.360 --> 28:24.760
Please go in.

28:25.480 --> 28:27.760
-Miss, do you have necklaces?
-Yes.

28:27.840 --> 28:28.680
-Please go in, Miss.
-Please go in.

28:28.760 --> 28:30.000
Please go in.

28:30.080 --> 28:31.360
Have a look.

28:31.440 --> 28:33.200
-Please go in.
-Miss, have a look.

28:33.280 --> 28:34.840
-Please go in.
-Lady Shijiu.

28:34.920 --> 28:36.120
It's a good sign

28:36.200 --> 28:37.480
that there are a lot of customers.

28:38.920 --> 28:40.040
Have a look.

28:40.120 --> 28:42.000
Zhenlang Pavilion is empty.

28:42.080 --> 28:44.720
-It won't last long,
-Have a look.

28:45.280 --> 28:46.600
if we only sell these.

28:48.360 --> 28:49.680
Right.

28:50.720 --> 28:52.080
-Please.
-Take care of the customers.

29:04.480 --> 29:06.440
Are you waiting for Mr. Wu?

29:07.400 --> 29:10.360
Mr. Wu was yelled at by Mr. Zheng
because of you.

29:10.440 --> 29:11.880
He was caned.

29:11.960 --> 29:13.640
He's probably still recovering.

29:14.160 --> 29:16.560
If we run Zhenlang Pavilion well,

29:16.640 --> 29:18.760
maybe the Zheng family will accept you,

29:18.840 --> 29:20.960
and Mr. Wu will be impressed by you.

29:22.640 --> 29:23.720
I didn't do it for him.

29:25.080 --> 29:26.640
Zhenlang Pavilion
belongs to the Cui family.

29:27.680 --> 29:29.000
Don't talk nonsense.

29:29.080 --> 29:30.200
Modify those pieces of jewelry

29:30.280 --> 29:32.000
and sell them.

29:33.240 --> 29:34.520
Yes, ma'am.

29:34.600 --> 29:36.200
Miss, come in and have a look.

29:36.280 --> 29:37.560
We have new styles.

29:37.640 --> 29:38.600
Come in and have a look.

29:38.680 --> 29:40.840
CLEAR MIND

29:41.520 --> 29:43.520
Let's see what Clear Mind will do.

29:51.320 --> 29:52.960
Cui Shijiu!

30:01.000 --> 30:02.000
Cui Shijiu,

30:02.080 --> 30:03.920
you're really ruthless.

30:04.000 --> 30:05.640
What are you doing here?

30:06.280 --> 30:08.120
You just got caned.

30:08.200 --> 30:09.800
Why don't you recuperate at home

30:09.880 --> 30:11.400
but come here?

30:12.000 --> 30:14.840
Zhenlang Pavilion
cost the Zheng family so much.

30:14.920 --> 30:16.120
If I don't come and have a look,

30:16.200 --> 30:18.120
my father won't leave me alone,

30:19.920 --> 30:21.000
and he will hit me hard.

30:21.080 --> 30:22.800
Don't worry.

30:22.880 --> 30:24.760
I will manage Zhenlang Pavilion well.

30:24.840 --> 30:26.000
I won't let others point fingers at me.

30:29.640 --> 30:30.600
Shijiu.

30:31.640 --> 30:33.880
Even if you run Zhenlang Pavilion well,

30:34.520 --> 30:35.880
it's meaningless

30:36.480 --> 30:37.560
to the Zheng family.

30:40.440 --> 30:42.240
Don't forget our promise.

30:44.720 --> 30:45.560
I have to go.

30:48.720 --> 30:50.040
ZHENLANG PAVILION

30:52.360 --> 30:54.240
Your leg is not healed. Don't walk around.

30:55.160 --> 30:56.800
Recuperate at Zhenlang Pavilion.

31:20.240 --> 31:21.080
QIN'S GLASS WORKSHOP

31:21.160 --> 31:22.720
Look, Yingtao.

31:22.800 --> 31:24.480
It's beautiful.

31:24.560 --> 31:26.640
The glassware I made in the past

31:26.720 --> 31:28.520
was old-fashioned.

31:31.440 --> 31:33.960
Mr. Qin, you have the best skills

31:34.040 --> 31:35.040
in Yangzhou.

31:36.200 --> 31:37.320
Only you can make my design

31:37.400 --> 31:39.800
come to fruition.

31:40.840 --> 31:42.640
It will be the first batch of glassware

31:42.720 --> 31:44.440
made by Clear Mind.

31:45.280 --> 31:47.360
I want it to impress everyone

31:47.440 --> 31:50.000
and be the best glassware in Yangzhou.

31:51.200 --> 31:52.440
Can we do it?

31:52.520 --> 31:54.760
Of course. Why not?

31:55.880 --> 31:59.040
As long as you hang in there,
there will be a turnaround.

31:59.120 --> 32:00.440
People should live

32:00.520 --> 32:02.040
with expectations.

32:04.000 --> 32:05.600
You can be a thief all the time,

32:06.200 --> 32:08.160
but you can't guard against thieves
all the time.

32:11.360 --> 32:12.400
The Zheng family is strong.

32:13.000 --> 32:15.200
You'll be busy dealing

32:15.720 --> 32:17.160
with their means.

32:17.680 --> 32:19.120
They will destroy you.

32:19.760 --> 32:21.240
I'm old.

32:21.840 --> 32:23.320
I can't handle it.

32:24.400 --> 32:26.520
I don't have the energy

32:27.440 --> 32:29.080
and the mood.

32:29.160 --> 32:30.640
Mr. Qin.

32:30.720 --> 32:32.920
They are evil.

32:33.000 --> 32:34.480
They bullied you before.

32:34.560 --> 32:36.520
Now, they are bullying Ms. Su.

32:36.600 --> 32:38.520
Who knows who they will bully later?

32:38.600 --> 32:39.800
It is not easy for Yangzhou

32:39.880 --> 32:41.640
to prosper.

32:41.720 --> 32:43.160
But it's easy

32:43.240 --> 32:44.120
to ruin it.

32:44.200 --> 32:47.080
We can't handle it.

32:47.160 --> 32:50.840
You're right. We are normal and weak.

32:50.920 --> 32:53.120
We need to stick together.

32:53.200 --> 32:55.040
The Cui family and the Zheng family

32:55.120 --> 32:57.240
have been in
the jewelry industry for years.

32:57.320 --> 32:59.160
When they're good, we're good.

32:59.240 --> 33:00.760
When they're not good, we're not good.

33:00.840 --> 33:01.720
Why?

33:01.800 --> 33:03.240
They are industry leaders.

33:03.320 --> 33:05.080
But they bully us.

33:05.160 --> 33:06.400
We must work together

33:06.480 --> 33:07.560
to fight them.

33:08.240 --> 33:09.240
Mr. Qin.

33:10.080 --> 33:12.920
I know we are weak.

33:13.520 --> 33:14.360
We can't beat them.

33:17.120 --> 33:19.200
I promise you

33:20.160 --> 33:21.600
that if you join Clear Mind,

33:22.120 --> 33:24.640
I will do everything to protect you,

33:25.560 --> 33:28.200
so you don't have to be
as scared as before.

33:30.200 --> 33:31.040
Trust me.

33:35.880 --> 33:37.160
I'm old.

33:38.320 --> 33:40.720
I don't want to get into trouble again.

33:40.800 --> 33:44.000
They will torture you.

33:44.080 --> 33:46.360
I've been scared

33:47.640 --> 33:48.640
all these years.

33:49.640 --> 33:50.920
Father.

33:51.000 --> 33:52.360
Mr. Qin.

34:05.000 --> 34:06.360
I understand.

34:10.360 --> 34:11.560
Mr. Qin.

34:13.639 --> 34:15.000
I'm sorry to bother you these days.

34:16.000 --> 34:17.040
Thank you.

34:19.679 --> 34:21.159
I'll give you

34:22.040 --> 34:23.480
the money.

34:23.560 --> 34:24.719
Don't worry.

34:28.920 --> 34:30.000
Thank you.

35:00.040 --> 35:01.920
My name was not Su Muzhe.

35:03.480 --> 35:04.920
Mr. Qin.

35:05.720 --> 35:06.560
You can call me Duanwu.

35:08.320 --> 35:10.640
I was a pearl diver in Hepu.

35:11.160 --> 35:13.240
I went through a lot to get here.

35:13.960 --> 35:15.640
I've known since I was a kid

35:16.480 --> 35:17.600
that people make things happen.

35:18.320 --> 35:19.560
You do it,

35:20.320 --> 35:21.720
so you make it.

35:21.800 --> 35:23.640
Maybe I'm stubborn.

35:24.160 --> 35:26.040
Even if it's a dead end,

35:26.120 --> 35:27.400
I will try to find a way

35:28.120 --> 35:29.480
out of it.

35:29.560 --> 35:30.880
If I hadn't tried,

35:31.800 --> 35:33.280
I wouldn't have come this far.

35:37.400 --> 35:38.800
I won't

35:42.400 --> 35:44.560
depend on others.

35:47.400 --> 35:48.640
I will

35:50.160 --> 35:52.000
find my way by myself.

36:07.560 --> 36:08.520
See you.

36:14.200 --> 36:15.160
Wait.

36:37.680 --> 36:39.160
This is a good place.

36:39.240 --> 36:42.280
This is the perfect place
for a glass workshop.

36:42.360 --> 36:44.600
Let's tidy up this place.

36:44.680 --> 36:45.840
Tidy it up, okay?

36:45.920 --> 36:47.280
-Okay!
-Okay!

36:47.360 --> 36:48.640
Come on. Let's get to work.

36:50.680 --> 36:51.800
Here. Duanwu.

36:52.600 --> 36:53.480
Careful.

36:56.520 --> 36:57.640
Careful. Let me.

36:58.920 --> 36:59.960
Let me.

38:35.120 --> 38:36.880
Probably… Here.

38:41.440 --> 38:43.040
Mr. Qin, look at this.

38:43.120 --> 38:44.240
Here.

38:46.040 --> 38:47.160
Here.

38:49.840 --> 38:52.240
Supervisor Kang, give me a hand.

38:52.320 --> 38:53.160
Okay.

39:12.960 --> 39:13.800
Let me.

39:24.040 --> 39:25.240
Push.

39:32.240 --> 39:33.320
Mr. Qin.

39:55.960 --> 39:57.000
Mr. Qin.

39:58.360 --> 40:00.320
-How about it?
-Ms. Su.

40:00.920 --> 40:02.120
The kiln is good.

40:02.720 --> 40:05.560
We can make glassware now.

40:05.640 --> 40:06.480
-Great.
-Great.

40:06.560 --> 40:07.600
Great.

40:08.200 --> 40:09.480
We made it.

40:10.080 --> 40:11.680
Yunxiu, we can make glassware.

40:11.760 --> 40:13.320
We made it.

40:13.400 --> 40:15.200
That's great, Father.

40:15.280 --> 40:17.040
VIRTUE SURPASSES MATERIAL TREASURE

40:23.800 --> 40:24.640
Mr. Wang.

40:25.200 --> 40:26.080
Inspector Zhang.

40:28.360 --> 40:31.200
I am here for Yangzhou Governor
Xu Nanying's bribery case.

40:31.280 --> 40:34.440
I was ordered to escort him back
to Chang'an for trial.

40:34.520 --> 40:35.920
You were ordered?

40:37.440 --> 40:38.640
Mr. Wang.

40:38.720 --> 40:40.280
You must have an imperial edict
from the Metropolitan Secretariat.

40:44.000 --> 40:44.920
Inspector Zhang.

40:45.720 --> 40:49.440
You have written to impeach Xu Nanying.

40:50.360 --> 40:53.960
But he's the governor of Yangzhou,

40:54.040 --> 40:55.920
one of the highest officials in Southeast.

40:56.960 --> 40:59.400
You've caused a lot of discussion

40:59.480 --> 41:02.000
by arresting him in the Governor's Office.

41:02.080 --> 41:04.440
Inspector Zhang, think about it.

41:05.160 --> 41:06.600
I think

41:07.440 --> 41:08.600
my impeachment

41:08.680 --> 41:10.600
should have just gone to the Chancellery.

41:11.800 --> 41:13.560
It shouldn't have been forwarded yet.

41:14.760 --> 41:15.720
Mr. Wang.

41:16.400 --> 41:18.880
How did you know I impeached Xu Nanying?

41:19.640 --> 41:21.000
You have to know

41:21.080 --> 41:23.040
that if the Chancellery leaks it out,

41:23.640 --> 41:25.000
you'll be guilty of a crime.

41:26.840 --> 41:27.680
Well.

41:28.840 --> 41:31.240
If you have an imperial edict
from the Metropolitan Secretariat,

41:31.320 --> 41:32.760
I'll do as you say.

41:34.520 --> 41:36.520
If it's just the Court of Judicial Review,

41:37.680 --> 41:39.560
you'd better leave.

41:39.640 --> 41:40.920
The Court of Judicial Review

41:42.360 --> 41:43.200
and I, the Inspector of Huainandao,
don't belong to the same department.

41:43.800 --> 41:44.880
You!

41:46.920 --> 41:47.960
Inspector Zhang.

41:49.040 --> 41:50.280
What is it?

41:50.360 --> 41:51.320
Inspector Zhang.

41:51.400 --> 41:52.720
Mr. Xu doesn't feel good.

41:52.800 --> 41:54.240
I didn't dare to make a decision.

41:54.320 --> 41:55.200
Please go there and have a look.

42:03.120 --> 42:04.640
Physician Lin, how is he?

42:06.480 --> 42:08.400
His pulse is disturbed.

42:08.480 --> 42:09.720
Give me some more time.

42:09.800 --> 42:11.760
Can I take him back
to Chang'an immediately?

42:12.400 --> 42:13.640
I don't think so.

42:13.720 --> 42:16.520
He could die on the road.

42:16.600 --> 42:17.560
No!

42:18.080 --> 42:19.280
I must

42:19.360 --> 42:21.280
take Mr. Xu to Chang'an immediately.

42:21.360 --> 42:22.200
Mr. Wang.

42:22.280 --> 42:24.520
Are you taking Mr. Xu back
for interrogation?

42:24.600 --> 42:25.880
Or do you want him to die halfway?

42:25.960 --> 42:27.880
Zhang Jinran! I'm telling you.

42:28.480 --> 42:29.880
If he dies in your prison,

42:29.960 --> 42:31.480
can you afford it?

42:36.320 --> 42:38.440
Mr. Xu. Mr. Xu.

42:39.040 --> 42:40.120
Can you hold on

42:40.200 --> 42:41.720
and go back to Chang'an with me?

42:42.320 --> 42:43.160
Mr. Xu.

42:43.240 --> 42:44.480
Mr. Xu.

42:44.560 --> 42:45.760
Mr. Wang.

42:45.840 --> 42:47.680
He's seriously ill.

42:47.760 --> 42:48.920
You'd better talk about it later.

43:01.040 --> 43:01.880
Go.

43:10.360 --> 43:11.200
Physician Lin.

43:12.400 --> 43:13.480
How is Mr. Xu?

43:15.120 --> 43:16.200
Inspector Zhang.

43:17.200 --> 43:19.720
I'm afraid that Mr. Xu

43:20.920 --> 43:22.280
was poisoned.

43:23.080 --> 43:24.400
He won't die,

43:24.480 --> 43:28.040
but he needs some rest.

43:29.720 --> 43:31.240
He was poisoned?

43:31.320 --> 43:32.400
Yes.
